    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leann sins</strong> is a story of lust, betrayal, and forbidden desires. Leann Cassidy, a famous photo model, lives a glamorous life but hides her unfulfilled cravings. With her husband unable to satisfy all her needs, Leann ventures into a world of temptations where moral boundaries blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538880/extras/b3d54e1cf508ec2a1f77e85932f7dbb0.avif?t=1747764191\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her journey is an exploration of her deepest fantasies, with each scene revealing the intensity of her sinful desires.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Tale of Sin and Seduction:</strong> A linear narrative that immerses you in the story without worrying about missed choices. Relax and enjoy the full experience without distractions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538880/extras/5282cf82d1f55d6dc5ec4e731b90aec0.avif?t=1747764191\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong> Engage with interactive elements and mini-games for an immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Mode:</strong> Sit back, relax, and enjoy the story unfold like a movie.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538880/extras/7daf99887b78b0b980ca4000c40220fe.avif?t=1747764191\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Voice Acting:</strong> Every character is fully voiced, adding emotional depth to the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals:</strong> High-quality art that enhances every sensual scene.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538880/extras/f7c40c12b487570803e9dd46d9c00357.avif?t=1747764191\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> A captivating score that heightens the atmosphere of each chapter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world where passion and sin lead to dangerous consequences.</p>",
